  <!-- EN: anti-torpedo torpedo body -->
  <DepthRim_AntiTorpedoBody.label>反魚雷魚雷彈體</DepthRim_AntiTorpedoBody.label>
  <!-- EN: A short, fast torpedo built to meet an incoming torpedo and detonate beside it. It cannot hit anything else.\n\nHas a slot for a warhead. -->
  <DepthRim_AntiTorpedoBody.description>短而快的魚雷，專門迎上來襲的魚雷，在它旁邊引爆。打不了其他東西。\n\n有一個戰鬥部槽。</DepthRim_AntiTorpedoBody.description>
