  <!-- EN: torpedo body -->
  <DepthRim_TorpedoBody.label>魚雷彈體</DepthRim_TorpedoBody.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavyweight torpedo hull with an electric motor. Slow, so the target has time to hear it coming, but it only travels by sea and keeps to the depth it was fired at.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance and payload. -->
  <DepthRim_TorpedoBody.description>裝電動馬達的重型魚雷彈體。速度慢，目標有時間聽見它接近；只能走海路，而且保持在發射時的深度。\n\n有戰鬥部、導引與酬載三個槽位。</DepthRim_TorpedoBody.description>
